OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 30 MAR
OL,4,G1600FSara Cox
OL,5,     GSara gets you through teatime
OL,6,     Gwith giggles and some fab music.
OL,7,     GPlus, she reveals the phrase for
OL,8,     GTotally Teavoted and a listener
OL,9,     Gplays Jukebox Jam.
OL,10,G1830FSara Cox's Half Wower
OL,11,     GSara plays the biggest and best
OL,12,     Gtunes to get you up dancing!
OL,13,G1900FJo Whiley's Shiny Happy Playlist
OL,14,     GJo brings her Shiny Happy
OL,15,     GPlaylist, 30 minutes of feel-good
OL,16,     Gmusic from 7-7.30pm to soundtrack
OL,17,     Glisteners' weekday evening.
OL,18,G1930FJo Whiley
OL,19,     GJo handpicks her favourite new
OL,20,     Gmusic from all genres of the
OL,21,     Gmusical spectrum and quality
OL,22,     Gvintage songs too.
